      "content": "Cal State Apply Cal State LA College of Business and Economics College of Business and Economics Undergraduate Advisement Degree with a Guarantee Department of Information Systems General Education Lower Division Courses University Catalog",
      "contentHtml": "<p><a href=\"https://www.calstate.edu/apply\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Cal State Apply </a></p><p><a href=\"http://www.calstatela.edu/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Cal State LA</a><a href=\"https://ecatalog.calstatela.edu/preview_program.php?catoid=70&amp;poid=31599\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> </a></p><p><a href=\"http://www.calstatela.edu/business\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">College of Business and Economics</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.calstatela.edu/business/advisement\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">College of Business and Economics Undergraduate Advisement</a></p><p><a href=\"http://adegreewithaguarantee.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Degree with a Guarantee</a></p><p><a href=\"http://ecatalog.calstatela.edu/preview_entity.php?catoid=11&amp;ent_oid=499&amp;returnto=778\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Department of Information Systems</a></p><p><a href=\"https://ecatalog.calstatela.edu/content.php?catoid=77&amp;navoid=11897\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">General Education Lower Division Courses </a></p><p><a href=\"https://ecatalog.calstatela.edu/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">University Catalog</a></p><p><br></p>"
